---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import PageIntro from '../components/PageIntro.astro';
---
<Layout title="Cookies" description="Cookie and browser-storage information for the Tarian Ventures website implementation.">
  <PageIntro label="Legal information" title="Cookies"><p>How this website implementation uses cookies and browser storage.</p></PageIntro>
  <div class="shell legal-content">
    <aside class="review-notice" aria-label="Review status"><strong>Review draft — deployment verification pending.</strong><p>Final wording requires a check of the published hosting configuration and browser behaviour.</p></aside>
    <section><h2>Website code</h2><p>The V1 website code does not set cookies or use local storage or session storage. It includes no analytics, advertising, trackers, third-party scripts or embedded content.</p><p>The navigation menu keeps its open or closed state only while the page is open; it does not save a preference to your browser.</p></section>
    <section><h2>Hosting verification</h2><p>Hosting services may behave differently depending on their configuration. Before publication, the deployed site must be checked for cookies, injected scripts and other network activity, and this page updated to describe the observed behaviour accurately.</p><p>No claim about unverified hosting behaviour is made in this review draft.</p></section>
    <p><a class="text-link" href="/privacy/">Read the privacy information <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></p>
  </div>
</Layout>
